Members And Staff, And Meetings Of The Board, Committee And Advisory Committee

(iii)
deductions for damage to or loss of goods expressly entrusted to the employed person for custody, or for loss of money
for which he is required to account, where such damage or loss is directly attributable to his neglect or default;
(iv)
deductions for house accommodation supplied by the employer;
(v)
